  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">enum class OpenMode :            <a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/integer\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::uint32_t</a> {...};</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This enumeration defines how a file shall be opened. The values can be combined (using | and |=) as long as they do not contradict each other.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n\n"
